{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01570","headline":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第四拍 · 刘商","name":"琴曲歌辞 胡笳十八拍 第四拍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山川路长谁记得，何处天涯是乡国？\n自从惊怖少精神，不觉风霜损颜色。\n夜中归梦来又去，朦胧岂解传消息。\n漫漫胡天叫不闻，明明汉月应相识。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘商","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01570.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01570","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}